          "name": "_renriched",
          "value": "[{\"admin_graphql_api_id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/7521611219011\",\"body_html\":\"<p><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Recently updated to now include Citrush, Coco Hinoki, and Solar Drip</span>. Play with all the possibilities and follow your nose. Mix, match, layer, and create combinations that suit your moods and multitudes\u2014because we\u2019d never box you into just one scent.</span></p>\\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\">The Exploratory Set includes ten 1.5ml sample vials of our perfumes:\u00a0<br><br>Woodphoria <br>Vanilla Era <br>Coco Cream\u00a0<br>Violet Ends\u00a0<br>Hinoki Fant\u00f4me<br></span><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\">Cowboy Kush\u00a0\u00a0<br><strong>Solar Drip <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">(newly added!)</strong><br></span><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\"><strong>Citrush <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">(newly added!)</strong><br></span><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\">Peachy Oudy<br></span><strong><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\">Coco Hinoki (newly added!)</span></strong><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\"></span></p>\\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\\\"1\\\">Bonus: you'll also receive a $10 perfume credit towards a future full size (50ml) purchase of your choice.<br><br>*Discount codes cannot be combined with any other offers or discounts including redemption of the Exploratory Set Credit. Discount excludes votive sets, bundles, sale items, Exploratory Sets and e-Gift Cards.<br><br><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\\\"><strong>Exploratory Sets are Final Sale</strong></span></span></p>\",\"category\":{\"admin_graphql_api_id\":\"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/hb-3-2-8-9\",\"full_name\":\"Health & Beauty > Personal Care > Cosmetics > Perfumes & Colognes > Perfume Sample & Discovery Sets\",\"name\":\"Perfume Sample & Discovery Sets\"},\"created_at\":\"2025-11-10T12:21:26-08:00\",\"description\":\"Recently updated to now include Citrush, Coco Hinoki, and Solar Drip. Play with all 